\## - 2026-09-30

\###  Version 1.3.0
 
\- Added Deep North Expansion Integration: Added official capacity scaling support for the Frigid Kiln and Frost Foundry expansion structures.
\- Overhauled the config binding system to implement AcceptableValueRange<int>. All capacity settings now automatically generate interactive, draggable range sliders (1 to 250) inside the BepInEx Configuration Manager menu.


\## - 2026-09-28

\### Added

\- Integrated full server-side configuration syncing powered by \*\*ConditionalConfigSync\*\*.

\- Added a global \*\*"Mod Enabled"\*\* toggle under the `0 - General` configuration category to dynamically shut down custom parameters and safely revert active crafting machines to vanilla game default capacities.

\- Added a centralized \*\*"Lock Configuration"\*\* setting for server administrators to enforce server-side settings over connecting players.


\### Fixed

\- Migrated deprecated internal Unity lifecycle hooks to pristine execution threads to fix assembly instantiation failures inside modern BepInEx architectures.



